        "title": "Level 2 Charging May Stop When the Vehicle Falls Asleep (TSB 08-249-26)",
        "description": "Stellantis TSB 08-249-26 covers North American 2024-2026 Fiat 500e vehicles. It documents a software condition in which high-voltage battery charging may stop unexpectedly while the vehicle remains connected to a Level 2 charger.",
